<title>USA: McCaw family ups Nextel stake by $233 mln.</title>
<headline>McCaw family ups Nextel stake by $233 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nextel Communications Inc said Tuesdy that Craig McCaw and family had invested an additional $232.5 million in the company by exercising its option to buy 15 million shares of Nextel common stock.</p>
<p>No shares in addition to the option shares were issued in conjunction with this exercise, the company said.</p>
<p>The McCaw family investment in Nextel is now about $600 million of the total potential investment of about $1.6 billion it agreed to in July 1995.</p>
</text>
